Error: Jet.TraitNotImplemented: `[Int:String]` does not implement `Decode`
  --> Tests/UI/codec_impl_map_key_decode_fix.jet:6:26
    |
  6 |     by_key: Dyn.object().decode<[Int:String]>() ?? [Int:String]{}
    |                          ^^^^^^
 Why: `Dyn.decode<[Int:String]>()` can only call the type's Decode contract
 Fix: A map's keys are text on the wire, so only a map keyed by `String` has `Decode`: use `[String:String]` and convert each key to and from its text
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.TraitNotImplemented
